critical: []

important:
  - id: i1
    section: User-Facing Configuration / Mode semantics + Pipeline (rich mode) / Bucketing
    pattern: Behavioral Ambiguity
    concern: "In 'always' mode the pipeline runs, but bucketing still classifies files as small-inline (which inlines raw diff with no summarization call). Undefined whether 'always' (a) only bypasses the threshold_chars gate (small-inline still applies), or (b) forces every file through a summary call (no small-inline bucket)."
    recommendation: "Add a clarifying sentence under the 'always' row of the Mode semantics table. Recommended intent: option (a) — bypass only the threshold_chars gate, bucketing still applies."

minor:
  - id: m1
    section: Pipeline (rich mode) / Status UI
    pattern: Behavioral Ambiguity
    concern: "'Summarizing N files in parallel...' — N is undefined. Could be large-file count, total non-inline files, or total summary calls."
    recommendation: "Define N as: count of large files + count of small-batched files (not batch count)."
